### GET org info (anonymous admin)
GET {{GRAFANA_HOST}}/api/org

### GET health (no auth needed)
GET {{GRAFANA_HOST}}/api/health

### GET org users (alternative to /api/users)
GET {{GRAFANA_HOST}}/api/orgs/1/users

### GET dashboards
GET {{GRAFANA_HOST}}/api/search

### GET
GET {{LOKI_HOST}}/loki/api/v1/labels

### GET
GET {{LOKI_HOST}}/loki/api/v1/label/job/values

### POST error log to Loki (CORREGIDO)
POST {{LOKI_HOST}}/loki/api/v1/push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "streams": [
    {
      "stream": {
        "job": "app",
        "level": "error",
        "service": "backend"
      },
      "values": [
        ["1729371209000000000", "Database connection failed"]
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### POST múltiples logs (CORREGIDO)
POST {{LOKI_HOST}}/loki/api/v1/push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "streams": [
    {
      "stream": {
        "job": "webserver",
        "level": "info"
      },
      "values": [
        ["1729371209000000000", "User login successful"],
        ["1729371210000000000", "Processing request /api/users"],
        ["1729371211000000000", "Response sent with status 200"]
      ]
    }
  ]
}


